WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:08.320
Hi!

00:00:08.391 --> 00:00:09.171
I'm Ana.

00:00:09.266 --> 00:00:10.799
Welcome to 'What to Say'!

00:00:31.651 --> 00:00:34.776
Do you know what to say when you need to deal with a problem?

00:00:34.838 --> 00:00:38.385
Listen out for useful language for dealing with a problem.

00:00:38.542 --> 00:00:41.284
Then, we'll practise saying the new phrases –

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.002
after this.

00:00:47.498 --> 00:00:48.100
Yuna!

00:00:48.108 --> 00:00:48.967
Oh, morning!

00:00:49.077 --> 00:00:50.670
I've got a bit of a problem.

00:00:50.702 --> 00:00:51.631
What's wrong?

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:53.563
Can we talk in private?

00:00:53.577 --> 00:00:54.577
Of course.

00:00:58.381 --> 00:01:00.663
Right, so, what's the matter?

00:01:01.491 --> 00:01:02.491
Well,

00:01:03.874 --> 00:01:05.030
I've made a mistake.

00:01:05.921 --> 00:01:06.921
A big mistake.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:08.386
OK.

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:10.746
 I'm sure we can work it out.

00:01:11.715 --> 00:01:13.848
It was such a silly thing to do!

00:01:14.996 --> 00:01:16.663
I'm getting worried now.

00:01:17.027 --> 00:01:18.527
What's going on here?

00:01:19.863 --> 00:01:20.697
OK.

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:23.017
It was late last night

00:01:23.517 --> 00:01:25.400
and I was tired

00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:27.954
I wasn't concentrating

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:29.330
and I

00:01:30.899 --> 00:01:36.282
accidentally used my company credit card instead of my own to buy something!

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:37.696
Don't worry,

00:01:37.852 --> 00:01:39.252
these things happen.

00:01:39.454 --> 00:01:41.578
There's a procedure to deal with this.

00:01:41.891 --> 00:01:43.425
How much did you spend?

00:01:46.253 --> 00:01:47.666
It was quite expensive.

00:01:48.385 --> 00:01:49.580
