00:01:56.621 --> 00:01:59.668
£3,782 …

00:01:59.731 --> 00:02:00.840
and 56 pence.

00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:01.996
What?

00:02:02.051 --> 00:02:06.168
 You spent £3,782?!

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.371
… and 56 pence.

00:02:08.629 --> 00:02:09.896
What was it?

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:13.801
