00:02:14.309 --> 00:02:16.566
Just a weekend break!

00:02:17.309 --> 00:02:19.933
I just like a really nice hotel!

00:02:21.428 --> 00:02:23.224
OK, I see.

00:02:24.358 --> 00:02:25.951
Thanks for letting me know.

00:02:33.846 --> 00:02:34.846
Ah!

00:02:35.424 --> 00:02:38.501
 I feel so much better now I've told you.

00:02:39.986 --> 00:02:41.564
